[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-rhodes-scholarship-2027-at-the-university-of-oxford-step-by-step-guide-279":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},279,"rhodes-scholarship-2027-at-the-university-of-oxford-step-by-step-guide-279","Rhodes Scholarship 2027 At The University Of Oxford: Step-by-step Guide","\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Rhodes Oxford Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: University of Oxford\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Study Abroad: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002F\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-uk\u002F\">Study-In-UK\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: United Kingdom (UK)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> ||  \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships\u002Fpostgraduate-scholarships\u002F\">Postgraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships\u002Fmasters-scholarships\u002F\">Masters Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Settling-in Allowance\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>£20,400 Stipends\u002FYr\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Visa + Travel Costs\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Deadline: Varies by Country\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University of Oxford Rhodes Scholarship Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Rhodes Scholarship 2027 is a life-changing opportunity to join outstanding young people from around the world to study at the University of Oxford.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Rhodes Trust Scholarship is looking for young people of outstanding intellect, character, leadership, and commitment to service. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Until recently, the Rhodes Trust Scholarship has only been awarded in 20 constituencies (representing over 60 different countries). Now the Rhodes Trust Scholarship is fully global: two new Global Scholarships allow eligible candidates from the rest of the world to apply.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University of Oxford Rhodes Scholarship Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>The Rhodes Trust Scholarship covers all University and College fees, a living stipend of £20,400 per annum (£1,700 per month); a settling-in allowance; health insurance; a visa; and two economy-class flights – to and from the UK – for the beginning and end of studies in Oxford.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>The basic tenure of the scholarship is two years, subject always, and at all times, to satisfactory academic performance and personal conduct.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Rhodes Trust Scholarship 2027 Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the postgraduate Rhodes Trust Scholarship 2027, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be a national of one of the eligible countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Aged between 18 and 27\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have already completed an undergraduate degree (normally a Bachelor’s degree).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have a sufficiently high standard of English to meet the English language proficiency requirements (at the Higher Level listed) of the University of Oxford.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You do not need to meet the English language requirement if English is your first language and you are a citizen of and have been primarily resident in a majority English-speaking country.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for the University of Oxford Rhodes Scholarship 2027\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the University of Oxford Rhodes Scholarship, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the details of the scholarship as provided on this page.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click on the button below to visit the Rhodes Scholarship page. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Test your eligibility by selecting your country of nationality.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>If you are from an eligible country, you will be directed to the application page.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click on APPLY and create your Rhodes account.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Complete the application by filling out the required details and uploading the required documents.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Shortlisted candidates will be contacted by email.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.rhodeshouse.ox.ac.uk\u002Fscholarships\u002Fapplications\u002Fglobal\u002F\">https:\u002F\u002Fwww.rhodeshouse.ox.ac.uk\u002Fscholarships\u002Fapplications\u002Fglobal\u002F\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-06-07 09:45:00",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Frhodes-scholarship-2027-at-the-university-of-oxford-step-by-step-guide\u002F6a252f8c6c8560.65529883_screenshot 2026-06-07 093710.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Frhodes-scholarship-2027-at-the-university-of-oxford-step-by-step-guide\u002F6a252f8c6c8560.65529883_screenshot%202026-06-07%20093710.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,38,48,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":31,"images":32,"datePosted":36,"authorName":37},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[33],{"fileName":34,"oldFileName":34,"type":18,"file":19,"url":35},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot%202026-06-24%20204255.png","2026-06-24 20:51:19","LINKSKOOL",{"id":39,"slug":40,"title":41,"images":42,"datePosted":46,"authorName":47},304,"mexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Mexican Government Scholarship For Foreigners 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[43],{"fileName":44,"oldFileName":44,"type":18,"file":19,"url":45},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c32aaeb8a11.62235495_screenshot 2026-06-24 201924.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c32aaeb